Z||000000||Cheever2||11-06-2000||07:25 PM||||Been in computer operations since December 1976.  IBM mainframes & AS400's.  I'm 43 freaking years old and still doing shift work and occassional weekends, sometimes even holidays.  Not real great for family life.<P>But - I have an interview with Southwestern Bell tomorrow morning for a PBX Technician job.  Had full responsibility for the phone system at a former employer, loved it, and hopefully it gave me enough experience to get this job that I think just might be my "dream job".  It will even be dayshift, Monday thru Friday.<P>I'll let you know how it goes.  Crossing my fingers.<P> ||||reg||7
