Z||000018||pherder||01-13-2001||11:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever2:<BR><B>So, when is Dark Angel on?<BR> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Tuesdays @ 8 PM FOX Network.<P>Also, congrats!  I'm a little older (49), had been doing PC support for 13 years but now (for the last 2 years) I am doing Remote Server support (Novell and NT) and don't normally deal with users!<P>I get to travel around the company and a lot of the travel has been 1st class seats  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I will be sick of travel after mid February since I will be on the road from next Tuesday until mid February. (home weekends, tho!)<P>Again congrats on the new job and I hope you enjoy!<P>Paul||||reg||1
